Signed-off-by: yipeng xiang <yipengxiang@honor.corp-partner.google.com>
(cherry picked from commit bdb23d0a80d76affaacfa1fb6e4bb163839b69a5)

Origin: android.googlesource.com/kernel/common 624cb7b2d62dfe314b6f7159eb2be53aec5b4f51
